{% set daily_prompt %}
Run the "Daily appointment check" from AGENTS.md.

Read {{ app_dir }}/future-appointments.md. Check today's date and weekday
against the `## Recurring` and `## Upcoming` sections.

If anything matches today: send a short Matrix message naming today's
appointment(s), in your own voice. For any one-off `## Upcoming` entry that
matched, move it to {{ app_dir }}/past-appointments.md (append it there,
remove it from `## Upcoming`) as described in the Housekeeping section.

If nothing matches today: do not send a Matrix message and do not produce any
other output. Silence means nothing today.
{% endset %}
{% set sunday_prompt %}
Run the "Sunday weekly check" from AGENTS.md.

Read {{ app_dir }}/future-appointments.md. First do the daily check: check
today's date and weekday (Sunday) against `## Recurring` and `## Upcoming`,
and if anything matches, note it and move any matched one-off `## Upcoming`
entry to {{ app_dir }}/past-appointments.md.

Then look ahead: list every appointment landing between the coming Monday and
Saturday — recurring rules whose weekday falls in that range, and any
`## Upcoming` entries dated in that range.

Always send a Matrix message today, combining today's appointments (if any)
with the week-ahead list. If there's nothing today and nothing in the week
ahead, say so plainly rather than staying silent — Sunday always gets a
message.
{% endset %}
[
  {
    "id": "daily-appointment-check",
    "name": "daily-appointment-check",
    "prompt": {{ daily_prompt | trim | tojson }},
    "schedule": {
      "kind": "cron",
      "expr": "0 8 * * 1-6",
      "display": "0 8 * * 1-6"
    },
    "deliver": "matrix",
